<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Electric cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Electric cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst William Tilles confirmed he cut his rating on American Power Co Inc and Duke Power Co to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
